Memory on an Alphaserver 800 is EDO ECC Buffered 60ns with a maximum of
256MB per stick.  You must install them in banks of 4 with a total of 2
banks.  The maximum memory allowed is 2GB.  IIRC it is the same memory
as in the Compaq Proliant 1600 series.  I picked up several gig on Ebay
last year for approx $125 a gig.  You may be as lucky.  I haven't
looked recently.



